and how your state funds it, the long term health of your tech, have you

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:35.600
retirement portfolio, or just the price of basic goods and energy flowing

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:38.960
through the Middle East, all of these threads connect directly to your wallet,

