job and global supply chains are a mess, people's behavior on a micro level

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:51.800
starts to change dramatically.

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:52.840
Oh, absolutely.

00:15:52.960 --> 00:15:57.360
And that brings us to maybe the most fascinating and frankly, the most fun

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:59.280
take away from all of these heavy sources.

